{"3307340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cast Outs", "steam_appid": 3307340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Be Part of Our Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/88c2a138f22f54e890db447b93d74bfd.avif?t=1782216383\" width=1170 height=214 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast Outs</strong> brings you the pure spectacle of magic where spellcasting hits with the physical impact of a brawler and the immediate kick of a shooter. Dive into the <strong>ultimate magical urban battleground</strong> where you and your friends can truly cooperate. It’s the perfect balance of quick-fix fun and high-octane action, <strong>built to be played together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/9323262637855033ab203f1705ca8875.poster.avif?t=1782216383\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/9323262637855033ab203f1705ca8875.webm?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/9323262637855033ab203f1705ca8875.mp4?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Feel every cast land like a punch, every blast hit like a shot.<br>It’s a visceral battleground where magic makes an impact, and <strong>you are the difference</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/48a6bbd096e560e4d70eb8d5c34f1fe5.poster.avif?t=1782216383\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/48a6bbd096e560e4d70eb8d5c34f1fe5.webm?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/48a6bbd096e560e4d70eb8d5c34f1fe5.mp4?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The real magic comes when spells collide.<br>Discover and master the endless ways your squad’s powers synergize.<br>Alone, you’re dangerous. Together? <strong>You’re unstoppable!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/d61042c1fc2cac7077b8ecfbb92e1e11.poster.avif?t=1782216383\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/d61042c1fc2cac7077b8ecfbb92e1e11.webm?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/d61042c1fc2cac7077b8ecfbb92e1e11.mp4?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>No two runs play the same. Mutators twist abilities, upgrade powers,<br>unlock new synergies, and <strong>keep every fight unpredictable.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/2c2a4c24f79f53e7648bfec02d8833ef.poster.avif?t=1782216383\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/2c2a4c24f79f53e7648bfec02d8833ef.webm?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/2c2a4c24f79f53e7648bfec02d8833ef.mp4?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fight back against an invading horde of orcs, ogres, cyclops, wraiths, dragons and more.<br>London is your arena and your home - <strong>take it back!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heroes with Evolving Playstyles &amp; Synergies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap heroes to explore new playstyles and synergies. Experiment, remix, and discover new team strategies every time you jump in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blockbuster Action in Bite-sized Sessions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 minutes or all night - Cast Outs delivers fast, high-impact sessions with zero grind, immediate fun, and endless reasons to dive back in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different Ways to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether 2, 3 or 4 players, you can support the cause to save the city by taking on combat runs, escort missions, horde modes, speed runs and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/ad54b951a3a8298e7dc9893d490b1717.avif?t=1782216383\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras_big/ad54b951a3a8298e7dc9893d490b1717.avif?t=1782216383 width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong>Built for synergy. Built for friends.</strong> <strong>Built for the stories you’ll be talking about long after the mission ends.</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast Outs</strong> brings you the pure spectacle of magic where spellcasting hits with the physical impact of a brawler and the immediate kick of a shooter. Dive into the <strong>ultimate magical urban battleground</strong> where you and your friends can truly cooperate. It’s the perfect balance of quick-fix fun and high-octane action, <strong>built to be played together.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/9323262637855033ab203f1705ca8875.poster.avif?t=1782216383\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/9323262637855033ab203f1705ca8875.webm?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/9323262637855033ab203f1705ca8875.mp4?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Feel every cast land like a punch, every blast hit like a shot.<br>It’s a visceral battleground where magic makes an impact, and <strong>you are the difference</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/48a6bbd096e560e4d70eb8d5c34f1fe5.poster.avif?t=1782216383\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/48a6bbd096e560e4d70eb8d5c34f1fe5.webm?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/48a6bbd096e560e4d70eb8d5c34f1fe5.mp4?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The real magic comes when spells collide.<br>Discover and master the endless ways your squad’s powers synergize.<br>Alone, you’re dangerous. Together? <strong>You’re unstoppable!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/d61042c1fc2cac7077b8ecfbb92e1e11.poster.avif?t=1782216383\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/d61042c1fc2cac7077b8ecfbb92e1e11.webm?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/d61042c1fc2cac7077b8ecfbb92e1e11.mp4?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>No two runs play the same. Mutators twist abilities, upgrade powers,<br>unlock new synergies, and <strong>keep every fight unpredictable.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/2c2a4c24f79f53e7648bfec02d8833ef.poster.avif?t=1782216383\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/2c2a4c24f79f53e7648bfec02d8833ef.webm?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/2c2a4c24f79f53e7648bfec02d8833ef.mp4?t=1782216383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Fight back against an invading horde of orcs, ogres, cyclops, wraiths, dragons and more.<br>London is your arena and your home - <strong>take it back!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Heroes with Evolving Playstyles &amp; Synergies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap heroes to explore new playstyles and synergies. Experiment, remix, and discover new team strategies every time you jump in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blockbuster Action in Bite-sized Sessions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 minutes or all night - Cast Outs delivers fast, high-impact sessions with zero grind, immediate fun, and endless reasons to dive back in.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Different Ways to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether 2, 3 or 4 players, you can support the cause to save the city by taking on combat runs, escort missions, horde modes, speed runs and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras/ad54b951a3a8298e7dc9893d490b1717.avif?t=1782216383\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/extras_big/ad54b951a3a8298e7dc9893d490b1717.avif?t=1782216383 width=1560 height=878 /></span><strong>Built for synergy. Built for friends.</strong> <strong>Built for the stories you’ll be talking about long after the mission ends.</strong></h2>", "short_description": "Urban fantasy collides with true co-op as you and your crew unleash visceral, physical magic, amplifying each other’s powers, and pushing back invaders in the fight to save your city.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/84de36877a124bdaad98919b4d543cfd32366bff/header.jpg?t=1782216383", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3307340/fdf48de22c62d3d78ff3a1be7c8ec400e1d5ca95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782216383", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co